claim = ('Source-only obligation mismatch: a synthetic prior-reference marker with no subjects is reused under consumed review/adoption edges, while publisher004 prime requires a nonempty subjects list when that path is first primed at such an edge. This supplies an explanatory pre-child E_SCHEMA path for the ten nonempty-prior composition cases. The saved attempt006 only reports the typed code inside AssertionError and has no original guard traceback; the review does not establish the observed first failing guard, exclude an earlier guard, or prove that this is the only repair needed. Templates have no prior marker dependency and their two observed E_NODE_BUDGET failures remain a separate unresolved node-cost question. Proposed fixture-only repair is subjects=[canonical] on the opaque reference marker, with exact supplied canonical fact3/body; preserve reference-only tag, false authority flags, all kernel guards and all expected case outcomes. Proposal only, no subject edit, target call, new scope, or qualification.')
